    <Single Name="Description" Type="string">LMC 300C / LMC 400C / LMC 600C PacDrive 3 Controllers up to 8, 16 or 99  axis control with sercos interface, 512MB RAM / 128KB or 256KB NVRAM, USB A, 100Mb Ethernet and Ethernet RTE, PROFIBUS / CANopen, RS485/RS232, PacNet, Incremental / Hiperface Encoder input, 36 digital IOs, 20 TP &amp; Interrupt inputs, 4 Analog IOs, 2 option slots

LMC 402C / LMC 802C / LMC 902C PacDrive 3 Controllers up to 16 or 130  axis control with sercos interface, 1024MB RAM / 256KB NVRAM, USB A, 1Gb Ethernet, 100Mb Ethernet RTE, PROFIBUS / CANopen, RS485/RS232, PacNet, Incremental / Hiperface Encoder input, 36 digital IOs, 20 TP &amp; Interrupt inputs, 4 Analog IOs, 2 option slots</Single>
